  "implementation": [
    "Explicit false-by-default legacybridge.developer.preservedUi client opt-in, separate menu route; ordinary ConversionScreen still uses preserved-disabled controller",
    "Bounded I/O-free typed form for existing admission, full data pins and explicit recovery identity; no implicit mappings/defaults/downloads",
    "Fresh backend review bound to form revision and operation UUID; edits or mode changes invalidate confirmation even if reverted",
    "Native explicit confirmation consumes one-use form token and independently checked coordinator review",
    "Client-owned immutable loader/world snapshot, atomic nonblocking worker access; unavailable or detached host fails closed",
    "Normal navigation/world entry blocked through owned screen opening while installation is accepted; OS/direct world/QuickPlay override not guaranteed",
    "Existing shared worker, queue, installer, recovery, shutdown lease and schemas reused; no additional executors or transformation rules",
    "Per-operation results, structured diagnostics, bounded searchable/paged read-only history; no authority or form rehydration from JSON",
    "Apply-and-close uses exact operation, idle state, safe terminal result plus receipt and closed world; Minecraft.stop is not restart",
    "en_us/pt_br and native edit boxes/buttons/confirmation/narrated scrolling; focus/cursor/resize handling implemented, visual QA not run",
    "SESSION_UNAVAILABLE retained instead of masked by SESSION_CHANGED when the host provider fails at confirmation"
